WEBVTT

00:15:30.491 --> 00:15:34.395
<i>Bulutlar oyalanmasa ya gökte</i>

00:15:38.822 --> 00:15:43.702
<i>O zaman hafifler yüküm biraz</i>

00:15:46.458 --> 00:15:50.705
<i>Ah Rab, Ah Rab
Nerede olacağım kim bilir yarın gece?</i>

00:15:54.744 --> 00:15:57.262
<i>Durma</i>

00:15:57.286 --> 00:15:58.596
<i>Kır zinciri</i>

00:15:59.760 --> 00:16:03.127
<i>Durma, kır zinciri</i>